{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b6a6cd99-65a5-5044-9d1a-8bfb95242df6", "source_ordinal": 663, "reading_ordinal": 3394, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "胆", "published_at": "2025-07-21T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/5db47566601f11f09a5152540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "企业里一般有两种工作，一种是当剑鞘，一种是当剑锋。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "剑鞘这东西，皮的也罢、木的也罢、塑料的也罢，只要能包住剑锋，防水防尘，稳固不脱落即可，及格万岁。", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 74}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "而剑锋这东西，则是越锋利、越坚固、越耐久越好，从无所谓“过于锋利”“过于坚固”这种说法，精益求精，永无穷尽。", "char_start": 75, "char_end": 129}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "当剑鞘的员工，好处是每项工作内容的预计花费时间相当可以预料，例如今天要扫地、换水、跑税务局领报表、去码头接货……", "char_start": 130, "char_end": 186}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "都有明确标准，只要做过，就会有一个比较确定的时间预期，于是只要一天时间没用满，就还可以塞入更多内容。例如知道你今天负责换水扫地，别人掐指一算，就知道你下午还有时间，就会安排你再去领表交材料。", "char_start": 187, "char_end": 282}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "当剑锋的员工呢，则干的是那些“无所不用其极”的工作。", "char_start": 283, "char_end": 309}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "例如开拓市场，例如研发新品，例如项目谈判，例如营销策划。", "char_start": 310, "char_end": 338}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这些工作没有“及格”一说，甚至没有“满意”一说。", "char_start": 339, "char_end": 363}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "谈下一个亿，还想要两个亿；减重到2.5吨，还想减到2.445吨。", "char_start": 364, "char_end": 396}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "因为一寸长就有一寸强。", "char_start": 397, "char_end": 408}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "没人会去叫“锋组”的人扫地。", "char_start": 409, "char_end": 423}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "因为没人会容忍“这个单子没拿下”和“昨天小李被老王指派去扫地了”这两件事同时发生——老王自己也没这个胆子。", "char_start": 424, "char_end": 477}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你会被人叫去扫地，是因为你是剑鞘，还没人用你当刀锋。", "char_start": 478, "char_end": 504}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "或者更深一点说——你还没有显露出“必然会被用在刀刃上”的明显特征。", "char_start": 505, "char_end": 538}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "因为哪怕你身上已经露出了这种锐利，对方意识到你很快要入选锋营，对方都会预留地步，以免给自己埋下不必要的隐患。", "char_start": 539, "char_end": 593}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这些才是你会有这种困扰的根本原因。", "char_start": 594, "char_end": 611}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "要说这样那样狡猾“智慧”的“应对话术”不是没有，但是如果你不改变ta人对你前途的悲观预期，这些话术挡得到一时，挡不了一世。", "char_start": 612, "char_end": 673}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "我反倒要劝你把“不得不接受这些安排”直接吞下，当作“我必发奋”的提醒来看。", "char_start": 674, "char_end": 711}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "卧薪尝胆者，无不强之患。", "char_start": 712, "char_end": 724}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "此胆苦，日尝之，可明志。", "char_start": 725, "char_end": 737}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "不用任何话术，永不拒绝，直到有一天老王自己不再开口安排你拖地。", "char_start": 738, "char_end": 769}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你就知道，你成了。", "char_start": 770, "char_end": 779}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 22}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0488"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：同事说：“办公室脏了，你没事拖一下吧”你该如何回复他？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022"], "summary": "围绕“胆”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“企业里一般有两种工作，一种是当剑鞘，一种是当剑锋。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "企业里一般有两种工作，一种是当剑鞘，一种是当剑锋。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b714bfe4-e4a9-5350-a3c4-f41807358b19", "source_ordinal": 662, "reading_ordinal": 3395, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "正念", "published_at": "2025-07-21T20:59:02.344000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1930392746654405330/answer/1930703435319211536"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "“正能量”固然好，但现在普遍的“正能量”的用法就约等于手机不插着线只能用半小时，全靠充电宝续命。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 48}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "充电宝们经常协议匹配不上，插也插上了，充电宝自己的电量直线下降，热得烫手，但手机就是充不进电，一拔就黑屏。", "char_start": 49, "char_end": 102}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这都还是好的，还有协议不匹配到一插就死机的。", "char_start": 103, "char_end": 125}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "然后充电宝们发愁，要来问“到底应该怎么供电”。", "char_start": 126, "char_end": 149}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "其实这不是供电的问题，也不应该视为供电的问题。", "char_start": 150, "char_end": 173}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "在你的小手机把自己的电路修好、坏电芯换掉之前，输电几乎没有意义。", "char_start": 174, "char_end": 206}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "人从来缺的都不是“正能量”，而是自己内生能量的机制。", "char_start": 207, "char_end": 233}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "天生就有一百瓦的发电功率，即使遇到一些西北风自己也不会轻易发寒，直到遇到了一百瓦都压不住的寒风，才需要靠几个自带一百瓦输出的热源背靠背抱团来减少散热，这才是人应该有的常态。", "char_start": 234, "char_end": 320}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "真正的问题是人内心自己的发热机制为什么失效了，是如何点燃这座反应炉。", "char_start": 321, "char_end": 355}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "所以，家庭教育的核心是要和那些不断侵蚀人的积极性、刺激人的消极性的作斗争，是要修好人的电路，找到失效的升压芯片或者脱焊点，而不是仅仅靠“插电”、靠“提供正能量”去续命。", "char_start": 356, "char_end": 440}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你要的不是“正能量”，而是“正念”——那种能化悲痛为力量、化耻辱为勇气、化挫折为斗志、化失败为启发的思维结构。", "char_start": 441, "char_end": 496}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "一勺海水浇你头上，你当场熄火。", "char_start": 497, "char_end": 512}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "浇我头上，我先给你把蓝绿藻滤出来存着培养，微生物留着养鱼，盐给你析出来做菜，铀235富集起来送反应堆，纯水还灌瓶给你卖了。", "char_start": 513, "char_end": 574}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "差别在哪？我身上一堆渗透膜，一堆管路，一堆交易机制，一堆提炼机制，还有核反应堆。", "char_start": 575, "char_end": 615}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "我不是露天的一堆柴，所以你不但浇不灭我，我还把你当矿采。", "char_start": 616, "char_end": 644}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "我当然不缺“正能量”，恰恰相反，我还把锅炉废热送进居民区收暖气费好伐。", "char_start": 645, "char_end": 680}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这些过滤、蒸馏、提炼、加工、提纯的结构设施，就是“正念”，这是要花功夫从一片荒地上建设起来的。", "char_start": 681, "char_end": 728}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "否则你真的是露天一堆柴，上面连个遮雨棚都没有，你真得要抱着我的暖气片生活。", "char_start": 729, "char_end": 766}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "采暖费你交得起么？", "char_start": 767, "char_end": 776}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "不要去“安慰”，而要给予真正的教育。", "char_start": 777, "char_end": 795}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "真正的教育是个什么样子呢？是在教育之后，原本觉得自己倒霉的沮丧的人，不但发现自己多么幸运，而且还变得振奋、积极、跃跃欲试。", "char_start": 796, "char_end": 857}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "那不是靠抱着别人的暖气片，而是靠教会它怎么用海水发电。", "char_start": 858, "char_end": 885}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "ta心里的反应堆运转了，就不需要“正能量”了。", "char_start": 886, "char_end": 909}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这反应堆点不亮，靠USB输电没用。", "char_start": 910, "char_end": 927}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 24}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0488"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：家庭教育中应该如何界定“正能量”？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024"], "summary": "围绕“正念”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：““正能量”固然好，但现在普遍的“正能量”的用法就约等于手机不插着线只能用半小时，全靠充电宝续命。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "“正能量”固然好，但现在普遍的“正能量”的用法就约等于手机不插着线只能用半小时，全靠充电宝续命。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 48, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "a3a51ad5-e854-5912-a7e2-52f177044815", "source_ordinal": 661, "reading_ordinal": 3396, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "风流", "published_at": "2025-07-22T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/61caa76a60d311f0abc952540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这一等人物，叫人不忍心用礼法责备ta。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你不希望叫李白“别那么多幻想”。", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 36}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你不希望教训阮籍“站有站相、坐有坐相”。", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 57}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你不希望说郑板桥“你能不能好好写字？”", "char_start": 58, "char_end": 77}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你不希望红拂女安守妇道，不要妄想李靖。", "char_start": 78, "char_end": 97}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你不希望韩世忠考虑家声，别娶梁红玉。", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 116}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你不希望要张旭戒酒、木兰解甲。", "char_start": 117, "char_end": 132}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你不希望鲁智深少管闲事。", "char_start": 133, "char_end": 145}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你不希望宝玉老老实实求取功名。", "char_start": 146, "char_end": 161}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你不希望倩女终为幽魂。", "char_start": 162, "char_end": 173}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你也不想说“当个图书管理员有什么不好”。", "char_start": 174, "char_end": 194}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "我在江湖，身不由己，", "char_start": 195, "char_end": 205}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "那么这人间的不得已，我来就好。", "char_start": 206, "char_end": 221}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "一个也罢，我愿有人可以活在这“不得已”之外，", "char_start": 223, "char_end": 245}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "放肆张狂，任性嚣张，", "char_start": 246, "char_end": 256}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "无法无天，无尊无长，", "char_start": 257, "char_end": 267}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "只要善良。", "char_start": 268, "char_end": 273}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "风流云上，清泉山岗。", "char_start": 275, "char_end": 285}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "繁星万里，明月大江。", "char_start": 286, "char_end": 296}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 21}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0488"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎么定义风流?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019"], "summary": "围绕“风流”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这一等人物，叫人不忍心用礼法责备ta。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这一等人物，叫人不忍心用礼法责备ta。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "04bfd910-2819-5fab-a687-fa0251fa5af3", "source_ordinal": 660, "reading_ordinal": 3397, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "四台阶", "published_at": "2025-07-22T11:11:07.229000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1929952687627153632/answer/1930764527496050095"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "对经济的影响不多说了，只谈一个“对外关系产生的影响”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 27}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "很多人都觉得我们建这个工程增加了对下游国家的威慑与控制，是“扼住了印度的要害”。", "char_start": 28, "char_end": 68}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这个想法完全是错的。", "char_start": 69, "char_end": 79}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这纯属以小人之心度君子之腹，对我们的治理风格完全不了解。", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 108}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "我们手握随时能毁灭敌人的力量，往往不是为了唤起敌人的恐惧，而是为了让敌人明白——我们不会因为拥有强大的力量就不择手段。", "char_start": 109, "char_end": 168}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "手里有足够强大的力量，会反过来证明我们说要讲道理是真诚的。", "char_start": 169, "char_end": 198}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "一个君主要永居王座，有四个阶段。", "char_start": 199, "char_end": 215}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "第一步，你要拥有力量。", "char_start": 216, "char_end": 227}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这一步，是靠你自强不息，苦练内功，自我检验，只需要你自己确信即可。", "char_start": 228, "char_end": 261}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "第二步，你要让别人承认你拥有力量。", "char_start": 263, "char_end": 280}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这一步，是靠你开始展现客观成就和自信风貌。你一身筋骨，当仁不让。要么威慑住对方的妄念，要么直接击溃对方自身敬畏的对手。", "char_start": 281, "char_end": 340}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "第三步，你要让人接受你拥有力量。", "char_start": 342, "char_end": 358}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这一步，靠的就是让对方在明确认知你拥有力量的前提下，确信自己仍然有安全、幸福的可能。", "char_start": 359, "char_end": 401}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你拥有力量，但你也凭多年的克制让对方确信你拥有力量这件事并不意味着ta将被奴役、被剥削。你的力量和对方的生存、幸福并没有根本不可调和的矛盾。", "char_start": 402, "char_end": 472}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "因此，对方在无法对抗你的力量的前提下，就必然在你所划定的规则内接受你所留下的那条仍然足以通向幸存甚至繁荣的道路。", "char_start": 473, "char_end": 529}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "一旦对方开始转向你所界定的这条共存共荣的道路，就如水流入水渠一样，对方就会停止再寻求想方设法破坏你所拥有的力量。", "char_start": 530, "char_end": 586}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "因为那不但对ta代价高昂，徒劳无功，而且极度危险。", "char_start": 587, "char_end": 612}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "一旦对方停止寻求破坏你的优势地位，ta就已经进入了接受你领袖地位的阶段。", "char_start": 613, "char_end": 649}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "第四步，你要让人愿意你拥有力量。", "char_start": 651, "char_end": 667}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这是指一旦你真的陷入某种自然带来的危机或者面对某种外部的挑战，这些已经接受了你的力量，并与你的道路协调发展了很久的远亲近邻，会宁可付出努力来帮你维持你的力量。", "char_start": 668, "char_end": 747}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "因为ta们不想换一位新的王，重新适应一次新的治理，面对未知的、常常是致命的风险。", "char_start": 748, "char_end": 788}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "到了第四步，你的治理就会得到人类所能得到的最强的健壮性。尽管这并不足以保证你仍能胜过一切未来的挑战，但这已经是人类所能努力的极限。", "char_start": 790, "char_end": 855}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "而这四步之中，最大的关口就是第二和第三步。在第二步，想要证明自己力量的新王往往容易过于急躁，在证明力量的同时引入了过多的恐惧，以至于给第三步埋下了过多的仇恨和怀疑，于是大幅的破坏了自己走过第三步的概率。", "char_start": 857, "char_end": 958}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "因为这些恐惧和怀疑是极为有力的，会不断的、极端的挑战新王的耐心。你刚狠狠的伤害了ta们，ta们怕你、恨你、处心积虑想要绊倒你的冲动必然会燃烧很久，而你作为已经在实战中获得了绝对自信的新狮王，往往会越来越想要用暴力去惩罚这种“捂不热的石头”“养不熟的狼羔子”。而一旦你过于冲动，就会陷入“恐惧-破坏-惩罚-恐惧加深-进一步破坏-更严厉惩罚”的循环，从而就此止步，并在长期的拉扯消耗中立第四步越来越远。", "char_start": 959, "char_end": 1158}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "于是当历史不可避免的挑战到来时，那些久罚不服的异邦不但不是你面对挑战的助力，反而是雪上加霜、落井下石的负面力量。", "char_start": 1159, "char_end": 1215}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "帝国往往也就就此陨落。", "char_start": 1216, "char_end": 1227}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "我们现在就在第二步的开头甚至已经是中间阶段，我们的领导层对这个大历史法则是绝对头脑清醒的，所以绝不会为了一点蝇头小利妨碍我们稳固治理整个世界的最终资格。", "char_start": 1228, "char_end": 1304}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "我们不会拿这个工程做任何印度人、美国人恐惧、鼓吹我们会做的运用。", "char_start": 1305, "char_end": 1337}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "因为这根本是愚蠢的短视行为。", "char_start": 1338, "char_end": 1352}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 34}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0488"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：雅鲁藏布江下游水电工程开工，会对我国未来的经济和对外关系产生哪些影响？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029"], "summary": "围绕“四台阶”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“对经济的影响不多说了，只谈一个“对外关系产生的影响”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "对经济的影响不多说了，只谈一个“对外关系产生的影响”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 27, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "de694da9-3413-5b49-98bf-44f551b534ca", "source_ordinal": 659, "reading_ordinal": 3398, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "正五负二", "published_at": "2025-07-23T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/8cbc6be661c511f0aa8c52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "对，你不会的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "为什么？", "char_start": 8, "char_end": 12}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "我跟你从头说起。", "char_start": 13, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你现在累的很大的原因，是因为你在用低效的方式承担你的课业。", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 51}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "我跟你讲一下学霸们现在是什么情况。", "char_start": 52, "char_end": 69}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "ta们是在用高效的模式对待课业，这点作业不但只需要一半时间做完，而且做的过程相当享受。这是第一轮获利。", "char_start": 70, "char_end": 121}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "做完之后第二天还可以通过老师的表扬、同学的羡慕再收取一次愉快体验。这是第二轮获利。", "char_start": 122, "char_end": 163}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "在一段时间后，家长得到老师良好的反馈后，学霸们还会得到家长的再一次奖赏和肯定。这是第三轮获利。", "char_start": 164, "char_end": 211}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这结束了吗？", "char_start": 212, "char_end": 218}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "没有，在过年的时候当ta的父母略带谦虚的说“没有没有，语文还不是满分”的时候，亲戚朋友爷爷奶奶外公外婆还要再给ta一轮认可和奖励。这是第四轮获利。", "char_start": 219, "char_end": 292}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这完了吗？", "char_start": 293, "char_end": 298}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "如果ta家是那种自建住宅区的大型国企或者乡村，ta还会得到街坊邻居、左邻右舍的再一轮肯定和奖赏。", "char_start": 299, "char_end": 347}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这个情况不多，我就算半轮吧。", "char_start": 348, "char_end": 362}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "加起来，学霸获得了四轮半获利。", "char_start": 363, "char_end": 378}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "而你对比起来呢？", "char_start": 380, "char_end": 388}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你主要是一回家就可以先玩一会儿，再发一会儿呆，这一段你得利了。但是这个收益到了很晚你很困了还要赶作业的时候，你又会觉得很难受，又亏掉了。这个就算你提前玩的快乐可以和晚上的难受抵消吧，算你不亏不赚。", "char_start": 389, "char_end": 487}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "第二天，你也没有老师的表扬、同学的艳羡。这一轮你没有收益，但你也没有什么特别的负面损失。", "char_start": 488, "char_end": 532}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "一周后，老师向我抱怨你作业质量不高、学习态度消沉，我又不高兴，于是你亏损一轮。", "char_start": 533, "char_end": 572}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "到了过年，爷爷奶奶问你怎么样，你也不好意思说，我说了也觉得沮丧。我的沮丧肯定会外泄到你身上，于是在学霸有收益的这个项目上你又亏损一轮。", "char_start": 573, "char_end": 640}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "左邻右舍这一项，你没有收益，但是ta们也不会说你，你也不会有损失。", "char_start": 641, "char_end": 674}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "如果我们把收益都算赚一分，损失就会亏一分。", "char_start": 675, "char_end": 696}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "那么做一次作业，学霸会赚5分，而你是亏2分。", "char_start": 697, "char_end": 719}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "世界上所有的事情其实都是这样，将来你长大了去做工作，也一模一样，只不过会变成一天的工作优秀的同事赚5分，而低效的同事亏2分。", "char_start": 720, "char_end": 782}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "说到这里，你是不是会很奇怪，为什么我给你的答案是“不，你不会”？", "char_start": 783, "char_end": 815}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "因为你现在才七岁。", "char_start": 816, "char_end": 825}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "我现在就把这个告诉你了。", "char_start": 826, "char_end": 838}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "从你现在到你长大，还有13年的时间。", "char_start": 839, "char_end": 857}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "在这13年里，你因为已经知道了这个公式，你就会不自觉的去观察是不是这么回事。你每次再想问这个问题的时候，你都会想起我说的这段话。", "char_start": 858, "char_end": 922}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "你大概会在一年之后——也就是我说的四轮获利的整个周期结束之后，算完总账，发现就是这么回事。", "char_start": 923, "char_end": 968}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "然后你会在第二年开始觉得“把作业拖到最后草草完成，从赚5变成亏2，真是亏得太惨了”。你就会开始想要改。", "char_start": 969, "char_end": 1020}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "但你想要改，却很难一次性改好。因为老习惯太顽固了，你会不断的觉得“太累了，但却没有得到什么表扬”然后滑落回去。", "char_start": 1021, "char_end": 1076}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "然后又觉得太亏了，又再次摸索尝试改变。", "char_start": 1077, "char_end": 1096}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "这个过程，你可能还会花掉一年。", "char_start": 1097, "char_end": 1112}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "但是你有一个好条件——我，你的父母——订阅了素问，我知道怎么帮你消除沮丧、不断重新鼓起勇气，恢复信念，并且会给你很多方法。", "char_start": 1113, "char_end": 1174}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "在这一年挣扎期结束，你有很大的概率会开始从做一次作业亏2的痛苦里走出来，开始尝到做一次作业赚5的快感。", "char_start": 1175, "char_end": 1226}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "然后你就会对这个一本万利的模式上瘾。", "char_start": 1227, "char_end": 1245}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "这个时候你大概不超过十岁。", "char_start": 1246, "char_end": 1259}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "等你二十岁的时候，你已经在做作业、做事这门生意上有了十年的赚钱经验，已经是老油条了。", "char_start": 1260, "char_end": 1302}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "所以，答案是“不，你长大了，不会这么累”。", "char_start": 1303, "char_end": 1324}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "因为你这辈子都不会忘记我现在跟你说的这番话。", "char_start": 1325, "char_end": 1347}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "不信你走着瞧。", "char_start": 1348, "char_end": 1355}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 44}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0488"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：儿子天天作业写到 12 点，有一天他突然问你，爸爸是不是我长大了就不用这么累了，你怎么回答？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041"], "summary": "围绕“正五负二”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“对，你不会的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "对，你不会的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "7072144a-1709-5d20-888b-f555df7de141", "source_ordinal": 658, "reading_ordinal": 3399, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "仓鼠", "published_at": "2025-07-24T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/30b04a4e628711f0974752540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "人类当然进化出了对知识获取的快感反馈。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你现在学习感觉不到快感，主要有两大原因：", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "1）你身边充满了“精炼糖”。以前你吃颗脆嫩的白菜，啃一口新鲜红薯，就觉得鲜甜爽口。现在可好，有人把糖分提取出来，精制到100%浓度，直接喂你粉剂。", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 114}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "甜得舌头都发麻、头皮都发紧。", "char_start": 115, "char_end": 129}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "直接喝一口蜂蜜再去啃那个萝卜，你还觉得甜吗？", "char_start": 130, "char_end": 152}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "为什么家长视游戏小说如洪水猛兽，就是因为萝卜虽甜，甜不过蜂蜜。", "char_start": 153, "char_end": 184}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "但你整天吃萝卜白菜可以健康成长，整天喝蜂蜜只会得糖尿病。", "char_start": 185, "char_end": 213}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "2）我们的学习对于知识本身讲得太多，对知识的价值展示得太少。真正甜的部分，不在于知道勾股定律，而在于可以算出屋顶要多少块瓦，在于算出这条大堤需要多少人填多少天的土，在于隔着几里地算出敌军的城墙到底有多高、你的云梯要造多长。", "char_start": 215, "char_end": 326}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "学会概率论，快感不在于考试得几分，而是打麻将随时知道现在手上的牌做成各种胡牌各有多少概率，而且这些概率每有一场新出牌都在急剧的刷新。最后你实际上是在通过你的出牌在与这条概率九头蛇搏斗，直到其它八个头都被你斩断，而最后这条蛇给你握住咽喉为止。", "char_start": 327, "char_end": 447}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "然而学校只教到了勾股定律的公式和查正余弦表。后面这部分，它们盘算着等你十五年后走上工作岗位再品尝。", "char_start": 448, "char_end": 497}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "糖你先含在嘴里，但包住糖的胶囊壳要十五年才化。", "char_start": 498, "char_end": 521}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你就像一只仓鼠，整个冬天的口粮都塞在腮帮子里，怎么可能有甜味呢。", "char_start": 522, "char_end": 554}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这就是为什么学习要好，一定要接触市场，要参与劳动。因为知识不和市场、不和劳动的感受结合，它的糖分是释放不出来的，而这些糖分才是学习真正的甜头所在。这是不能用老师的夸奖、同学的羡慕、家长的肯定来替代的。", "char_start": 555, "char_end": 655}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0488"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么人类不进化出让自己在学习时分泌多巴胺的机制？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013"], "summary": "围绕“仓鼠”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“人类当然进化出了对知识获取的快感反馈。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "人类当然进化出了对知识获取的快感反馈。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "200309fc-1b48-536f-8a58-7f6e61f9436e", "source_ordinal": 657, "reading_ordinal": 3400, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "我没有", "published_at": "2025-07-24T17:06:50.085000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1896278314173317963/answer/1931762005984928653"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你就老老实实的说明事情经过就可以了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这倒不见得一定意味着你会被判无罪——因为很多人是真的法盲，不知道自己的行为其实是罪行——但是对你已经是最好的策略。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 76}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "因为警察也是人，对你的表达是有情绪感应的，在ta们眼里，对“什么样的反应是一个犯罪者的反应”是有一个神秘的标准的。", "char_start": 77, "char_end": 134}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你老老实实的，问什么说什么，不美化、不夸张、不遮遮掩掩、不吞吞吐吐，警察自己就会对这个案子是否成立有一个最初的直觉。", "char_start": 135, "char_end": 193}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "如果这个直觉告诉警察自己的内心“这个人比较实事求是，那个人自我幻觉比较严重”，他们就往往有了结论。案件办理的方向就会发生转变。", "char_start": 194, "char_end": 257}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "其实警察考虑问题的方式是如果自己的判断遭遇当事人的抗辩、质疑，第三方会站在哪一边的立场上。", "char_start": 258, "char_end": 303}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "第三方不知事实真相如何，就会很自然的站在情绪比较稳定、态度比较理智、表达淡定、严谨、平实的一方，而不会站在情绪激烈、表达夸张、颠三倒四、给人强烈幻觉感的一方。", "char_start": 304, "char_end": 383}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "正如警察自己会做的选择一样。", "char_start": 384, "char_end": 398}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "而一旦警察有了这种倾向性，案件的办理走向就会发生对你比较有利的微妙变化——ta们会更倾向于在对方稀里糊涂的描述里找到问题，去形成最终的结论。", "char_start": 399, "char_end": 469}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "换言之，警察的默认看法是真相在你们双方的表述之间的某个地方，但看到你们的表现，警察最终的结论会距离对方的比较远，而距离你的比较近。", "char_start": 470, "char_end": 535}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "所谓“坚决不承认”之类的“战术”其实是没什么好处的。", "char_start": 536, "char_end": 562}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 11}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0488"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：自愿发生关系后，真的是女性报警说强奸，罪名就成立吗？如果是普通人又该如何避免自己被诬告？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011"], "summary": "围绕“我没有”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你就老老实实的说明事情经过就可以了。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你就老老实实的说明事情经过就可以了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "81a27eae-342f-566e-9dec-eb69e613cdb8", "source_ordinal": 656, "reading_ordinal": 3401, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "龟", "published_at": "2025-07-25T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/c0436da2635511f0b63552540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "一次性的把这个问题跟你讲清楚。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "女性是安全感的动物，而引发女性安全焦虑的最大的原因，就是你的傲慢。", "char_start": 16, "char_end": 49}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你是她最大的同伴、最重要的同盟和合伙人，在很大程度上，因为每月一次的生理脆弱问题以及生育——尤其是反复生育——带来的动辄半年的脆弱时期，她基本上本能的要在自己陷入准受伤——甚至是准重伤——状态下，完全的依赖你的判断力和执行力。", "char_start": 50, "char_end": 163}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "尤其是你的判断力。", "char_start": 164, "char_end": 173}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "因此，一个成熟的女性，不但对男性的傲慢极端敏感，而且无法容忍。", "char_start": 174, "char_end": 205}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "她们不需要懂得你谈论的术语，不需要了解项目的背景情报，仅仅通过你的肢体语言、微表情、语气、音调，凭着直觉，就能察觉到你自己无法察觉的、无法从逻辑和实证上清晰解析的傲慢。", "char_start": 206, "char_end": 290}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "一旦察觉到你的傲慢，尤其是发现你对自己的傲慢没有相应的警惕，她对你的所有好感都会被她自己无法抑制的焦虑磨损，直到消耗干净。", "char_start": 291, "char_end": 352}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "她会通过很多方式尝试解决这个问题，她会尝试忽略焦虑，会尝试和你讨论，会尝试获得某种间接的积极信号，直到向你表达焦虑、展现抑郁、终至于争吵。", "char_start": 353, "char_end": 422}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "她关心的所有的问题，追根到底，究其本质，万变不离其宗，就是一句话——她要依赖你的判断，而你因为傲慢而让她无法相信你的判断力。", "char_start": 423, "char_end": 485}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这其中，最常见、然而最顽固的傲慢之一，就是认为女人一定会喜欢“龟男”。", "char_start": 486, "char_end": 521}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "即使明确的告诉了，甚至不惜给予侮辱性的负反馈，一些不知用什么词汇形容的雄性人类，百折不回的、无视一切负面信号和反面例证的、如宗教信仰一般的、虔诚的、全心全意的、宁死不屈的坚信——不，信仰——着“没有女人不喜欢小意儿体己”。", "char_start": 522, "char_end": 633}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "相信“只要功夫深，铁杵磨成针”。", "char_start": 634, "char_end": 650}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "他们就是不相信女性不喜欢这类想靠贿赂和嫖资购买性机遇的行为。", "char_start": 651, "char_end": 681}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "所谓“如何避免当龟男”这种问题，是一个有着这种坚定信仰——即坚信女人爱被收买、可被收买——的人，在问“我如何可以少出点”。", "char_start": 682, "char_end": 743}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "他们不信女人根本就不吃这一套，而是坚信这一套是唯一真理，在哀求天赐锦囊，让他们不至于成为最悲惨的案例——龟男——也就是“出了很大的价钱，还没捞到一发，也不知道啥时候是个头”这种最悲物种。", "char_start": 744, "char_end": 837}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "他们不是要求离开这条路，而是在求要么不出很大价钱，要么至少捞到一发，要么知道啥时候是个头。", "char_start": 838, "char_end": 883}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "就因为他相信女人就是这样的动物，于是就算女人当面告诉他、把奶茶泼他脸上，他都不会考虑“女人根本不是这样”的可能性。", "char_start": 884, "char_end": 941}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "他只是以为“想当龟男”就不可能是傲慢了。", "char_start": 942, "char_end": 962}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "殊不知，认为“当龟男必有用”，本身就是更下流、更愚蠢的傲慢。", "char_start": 963, "char_end": 993}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "如何可以不当龟男？仅仅只需要你相信“当龟男没用，甚至有反作用”就可以。", "char_start": 994, "char_end": 1029}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "只要你改掉这份傲慢就可以。", "char_start": 1030, "char_end": 1043}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "注意，改掉了只能保证你不当龟男，不能保证你能得到女性的倾心。", "char_start": 1044, "char_end": 1074}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "要得到女性的倾心，你更需要的是在捕猎、建造、探索、防卫、战斗、撤退、谋划、应变……等等等等事务上展现出准确的判断力和有效的执行力。", "char_start": 1075, "char_end": 1140}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "而要在这些事情上展现这些能力，你必须不愚蠢，而不傲慢是不愚蠢的起点。", "char_start": 1141, "char_end": 1175}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你放心，你做这些，自有女性在暗中观看。", "char_start": 1176, "char_end": 1195}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "你功夫到了，自有机缘发生。", "char_start": 1196, "char_end": 1209}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "不要把眼光盯在女人身上，要盯在狮子身上。", "char_start": 1210, "char_end": 1230}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "找到狮子，伏击狮子，战胜狮子，把狮子扛在肩上回到部落，然后不要得意忘形，不要宣称战无不胜。", "char_start": 1231, "char_end": 1276}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "然后你晚上不要关帐篷就行了。", "char_start": 1277, "char_end": 1291}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 31}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0488"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何避免当龟男？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029"], "summary": "围绕“龟”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“一次性的把这个问题跟你讲清楚。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "一次性的把这个问题跟你讲清楚。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
